        <li><strong>Medical certificate:</strong> Some consulates may have different medical forms or only require it in certain cases.</li>
      </ul>

      <p style="margin-bottom: 0;"><strong>What to do:</strong> Visit your consulate's official website. Download their student visa requirements document. If anything is unclear, email the consulate directly. Do not guess. Getting it wrong means your application is rejected and you lose your appointment slot.</p>
